WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Developers” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Open Developers
From Settings & channels choose “Developers”. This page needs a permission and a plan that supports the feature.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Create a key with a clear name
Write a name that explains the integration, then press “Create key”. The video uses a training key that is revoked after recording.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Copy and hide the key
The key shows only once. “Copy” copies it and “Hide” hides it from the screen. Don't put your key in the website interface or in public recordings.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Revoke the key
The “Revoke” button stops this key being accepted after you confirm. Update the connected system with a replacement key when needed.
